+# HECTON-8 Celestial Cataclysm Specification
+
+Date: 2026-05-05
+Status: PENDING VERIFICATION
+
+## Mandates Followed
+
+- `.agents-skills/VOX_Voxel_World_Logic_Carving_Persistence.txt`
